[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m Using the quadratic formula \(n = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}\) with \(a = 1\), \(b = -3\), and \(c = 1\), we have:
